          hs3fr i hi0 hi1 hi2 hi6 hi10,
          hs2fr i hi1 hi4]
        exact hs1fr i hi0 hi2 hi4 hi6
      · rw [hs5k, hs4k, hs3k, hs2k, hs1k]
      · intro x k hd1 hd2 hd3
